<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Halliburton raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Halliburton raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has raised its rating for Halliburton Co to buy from neutral, a source at the firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The energy company's stock closed at 69-1/8 on Friday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
